          "n": "1",
          "text": "He has studied English for ten years."
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I was looking for a driver."
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "He will be doing his homework."
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "He has been looking for a clue."
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Either you or I should do it."
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Neither you nor I am responsible for it."
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "He ran so fast that I could not keep up with him."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Three bombs exploded, one injuring 25 people."
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "He worked hard, hoping to pass the entrance examination."
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Three bombs exploded, killing three people."
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "He read the letter, tears pouring down his cheeks."
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "He being sick, I took his place."
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "He escaped, afraid he would be punished."
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Having finished the homework, I had nothing to do."
        },
